Keys Zurbax trusts to sign system updates: one *.pub file each, holding the
hex of an uncompressed P-256 public key (65 bytes: 04 || X || Y). zupdate
installs an update only when its description (release) carries a signature
(release.sig) from one of them. tools/update-publish.sh --new-key makes a key;
its private half never goes in this repository.
